 "open_questions": [
  "The GetTempFileNameW page gives the form <path>\\<pre><uuuu>.TMP; both builds write \".tmp\" in lower case and the number without leading zeros (rows temp_name.long_prefix: abc1.tmp). w2m follows the rows.",
  "Where NTFS stops keeping data in the file record lies between 721 and 739 bytes and depends on what else the record holds (the name's length among it); w2m keeps 720 and below there, the largest size a row holds resident.",
  "uUnique 0 takes its number from GetTickCount's milliseconds in w2m; the page says \"the current system time\" and the rows print the number only as matching the name. A uUnique whose low 16 bits are 0, a directory past MAX_PATH-14 (the page's ERROR_BUFFER_OVERFLOW), other information classes, and handles of other kinds (pipes, events, the console) are not in the rows and stop the run.",
  "CloseHandle on a handle with PROTECT_FROM_CLOSE is not probed (Windows raises under a debugger); w2m stops."
 ],
